Package: biostats625
Type: Package
Title: Linear Regression Analysis and Prediction Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiaoyu", "Lin", email = "xylin@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a collection of functions for performing, interpreting, and evaluating 
    ordinary least squares (OLS) linear regression. Includes tools for model fitting 
    ('linreg_fit'), model interpretation ('linreg_interpret'), exploratory data statistics 
    ('data_info'), prediction for new observations ('linreg_predict'), and confidence interval 
    calculation for model parameters ('CI_Calculator'). The package also includes 
    unit testing, a vignette, and benchmarking to address performance and accuracy.
